category: Devel
requires: cygwin libgcc1 liblutok3 libsqlite3_0 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Testing framework for infrastructure software"
ldesc: "Kyua is a testing framework for infrastructure software, originally designed
to equip BSD-based operating systems with a test suite. This means that Kyua
is lightweight and simple, and that Kyua integrates well with various build
systems and continuous integration frameworks."

